ACT IV OF 2023
LAHORE UNIVERSITY OF BIOLOGICAL AND APPLIED
SCIENCES ACT, 2023
An Act to provide for the establishment of the Lahore University of
Biological and Applied Sciences
[Gazette of Punjab Extraordinary,8th February, 2023]
No. PAP/Legis-3(116)/2022/97, dated 8.2.2023.---The Lahore University of Biological and Applied
Sciences Bill 2022, having been passed by the Provincial Assembly of the Punjab
on the 11th day of January 2023, and assented to by the Governor of the Punjab
on the 23rd day of January 2023, is hereby published as an Act of the
Provincial Assembly of the Punjab.
WHEREAS it is expedient to provide for
the establishment of the Lahore University of Biological and Applied Sciences
in the private sector and to provide for matters connected therewith and
ancillary thereto;
Be it enacted by Provincial Assembly of
the Punjab as follows:
2. Definitions.---In this Act:
(a) "Academic
Council" means the Academic Council of the University;
(b) "Act"
means the Lahore University of Biological and Applied Sciences Act, 2023;
(c) "Affiliated
College" means a college duly affiliated by the University;
(d) "Authority"
means any of the authorities of the University;
(e) "Board"
means the Board of Governors of the University;
(f) "Chairperson"
means the Chairperson of the Board of Governors of the University;
(g) "Chancellor"
means Governor of the Punjab;
(h) "College"
means a constituent college or an affiliated college;
(i) "Commission"
means the Higher Education Commission established under the Higher Education
Commission Ordinance 2002 (LIII of 2002);
(j) "Company"
means Lahore Medical and Dental College Limited which shall be the sponsoring
body of the University;
(k) "Constituent
College" means a college maintained, administered and managed by the
University;
(l) "Controller
of Examinations" means the Controller of Examinations of the University;
(m) "Dean"
means the Head of a Faculty of the University;
(n) "Department"
means a Teaching Department maintained and administered or managed by the
University in the prescribed manner;
(o) "Employee"
means all individuals employed by the University other than Teachers.
(p) "Faculty"
means an Administrative and Academic Unit of the University consisting of one
or more Departments or Colleges as may be prescribed;
(q) "First
Statutes" mean the Statutes provided in the Act;
(r) "Government"
means Government of the Punjab;
(s) "Head
of Department" means the Head of a Department;
(t) "Institute"
means an Institute maintained and administered or managed by the University;
(u) "Prescribed"
means prescribed by the Board, Rules, Statutes or Regulations;
(v) "Principal"
means Principal of a Constituent College;
(w) "Punjab
Higher Education Commission" means Punjab Higher Education Commission set
up under the Punjab Higher Education Commission Act, 2014 (I of 2015);
(x) "Registrar"
means the Registrar of the University;
(y) "Registered
Graduate" means a Graduate of the University who has his/her name entered
in the register maintained for the purpose;
(z) "Schedule"
means the Schedule appended to the Act;
(aa) "Sponsoring
Body" means the Company;
(bb) "Statutes",
"Regulations" and "Rules" mean and include respectively the
First Statutes, Statutes, Regulations and Rules made under the Act;
(cc) "Student"
means a student of the University;
(dd) "Sub-Campus"
mean a Sub-Campus of the University established in the Prescribed manner;
(ee) "Teacher"
includes a Professor, Associate Professor, Assistant Professor or Lecturer
engaged/employed by the University and such other persons as may be Prescribed;
(ff) "Treasurer"
means the Treasurer of the University;
(gg) "University" means the
Lahore University of Biological and Applied Sciences, constituted under the
Act; and
(hh) "Vice
Chancellor" means the Vice Chancellor of the University.
